{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9af031ce592c2c26","name":"Space Mines","source":{"id":"source:reference-9af031ce592c2c26","title":"Space Mines","revision":18801,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:45:24Z","sha256":"9d9e846ebbe214dc347fabb41394d089959be66f5e5041abb5f98444c50f5211","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18801","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Space%20Mines&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9af031ce592c2c26","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SPACE MINE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DAMAGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EP\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["AVAILABILITY\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SIZE RESTRICTION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Launcher\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5,000\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Standard\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["7d10x2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1,000\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Advanced\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["9d10x2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5,000\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Heavy Launcher\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["4\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Colossal (Frigate) or Larger\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5,000\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Heavy\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["6d10x5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Colossal (Frigate) or Larger\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5,000\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["A Space Mine Launcher carries a Starship's Space Mine payload. All Space Mine Launchers hold six Space Mines. Additional capacity may be added, increasing the cost by 25% per each additional Space Mine (up to a maximum of twelve Space Mines).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Space Mine can be deployed as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," at any point along a Starship's movement path. Whenever any ship enters a square in which a Space Mine was deployed, the Space Mine detonates and makes an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," against the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of all ships in that square. On a hit, it deals full damage to the target; on a miss, it deals only half damage. It is also possible for Space Mines to be designed not to be detonated by ships with specific IFF codes (to allow defenders to fly freely past them) or to be command-detonated (requiring a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," to detonate them as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", often after ",{"tag":"a","children":["Readying an Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Readying_an_Action"},").\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Space Mine has a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," bonus of +5 (including size modifiers), which sets the DC to notice the Space Mine. Whenever a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," is about to enter the same square as a Space Mine, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to notice the Space Mine and choose a different square to move into instead. If the ship has a ",{"tag":"a","children":["System Operator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/System_Operator","referenceId":"reference:75f56e8f22b64ca4"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["System Operator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/System_Operator","referenceId":"reference:75f56e8f22b64ca4"}," may make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," as well, using the ship's sensors to detect the Space Mine.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A typical Space Mine has a +5 attack bonus and deals 7d10x2 points of damage. An Advanced Space Mine has a +10 attack bonus and deals 9d10x2 points of damage. A Heavy Space Mine has a +5 attack bonus and deals 6d10x5 points of damage; however, like all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"}," weapons, it takes a -20 penalty on attack rolls against targets of smaller than Colossal size.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
